1	// The Agent's ways of connecting, drawn once for every surface that offers
2	// them: the JusPrin account block, one row per provider key, and one row per
3	// AI tool (canvas "JusPrin v2": Agent/Account Row, Agent/Provider Row,
4	// Agent/Your Own API Key and Agent/Tool Row, decided 2026-10-21). Preferences
5	// › Account holds the account; Preferences › BYOAI the keys and the tools.
